        "created_at": "2015-04-22T23:10:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was facing against the Matriarch on Advanced (Chorts are indestructble). She was at 4 HP, and one of her cohorts was at -3 HP.</p><p>Then the Kraken came out, and i thought he'd hit the matriarch, but hit the Cohort instead.</p><p>Is this intentional? A bug? How do indestructible targets work whtn the lowest target is hit?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:36.154Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
