        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I was facing against the Matriarch on Advanced (Chorts are indestructble). She was at 4 HP, and one of her cohorts was at -3 HP.</p><p>Then the Kraken came out, and i thought he&#39;d hit the matriarch, but hit the Cohort instead.</p><p>Is this intentional? A bug? How do indestructible targets work whtn the lowest target is hit?</p>",
