        "id": 140808,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-22T23:15:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No bug. &nbsp;Indestructible targets can get negative health, and will count as the lowest targets when they do (assuming that nothing else is even lower).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Heck, this can even happen with Explosive Wagon. &nbsp;Volitile Parts will target an exploding Explosives Wagon every single time. &nbsp;(barring other indestructible shenanigans such as the Cohorts)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:47.045Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
