        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>No bug. &nbsp;Indestructible targets can get negative health, and will count as the lowest targets when they do (assuming that nothing else is even lower).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Heck, this can even happen with Explosive Wagon. &nbsp;Volitile Parts will target an exploding Explosives Wagon every single time. &nbsp;(barring other indestructible shenanigans such as the Cohorts)</p>",
